data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"check-inputs says all 5 inputs present, nothing missing. So `missing` is an empty array.\n\nNow write the readback JSON:\n- member: \"orchestrator\"\n- role: \"orchestrator\"\n- branch: \"cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>\" (from member.json)\n- missing: []\n- goal: one sentence in my own words — design, build, and serve a small React UI (greeting + colour-changing button) using the codesweep design system, served on 0.0.0.0:5173.\n- scope: I own the design (DESIGN.md) and the outcome; I delegate implementation to developer and verification to qa, and must not write the application myself.\n- obligations: reply to dispatches (never end a turn without replying), commit work to my own branch because the machine is destroyed at campaign end, and write durable results to the output dir — otherwise the work is lost.\n\nWrite to /tmp/readback.json, single line. Use write tool."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793342503,"id":"chatcmpl-7d8ed7b7","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

